From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 08:33:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add HC Finance Status module: fee tracking, reconciliation,
 expenses

Adds a company-wide finance module alongside the existing underwriting
engine: a commission fee engine banding HC's % by channel (broker/direct)
and plan tier per the agreed rate card, with manual overrides for
Group/mixed-tier business; a payment tracker plus ingestion for the
working tracker spreadsheet, QIC Statement of Account exports (both real
export shapes seen), and HC's own bank statement; three reconciliation
reports (tracker vs. QIC SOA, QIC SOA period-over-period, tracker
"Received" rows vs. bank credits); and payroll/recurring/expense tracking
feeding a monthly cash-flow report and a documented-assumption expense
forecast. All ingestion and fee-calculation logic was validated against
real sample tracker/SOA/bank-statement data before landing.

Backend/API only in this pass - see README's Known limitations for the
planned web UI follow-up.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
